I wouldn't ever use doors to raise stats.  If I wanted to raise Str,
then it's much faster in realtime to push boulders.  If I wanted to
raise Dex, then it's much better to repeatedly lock and unlock
something.  And if I'm playing a non-pacifist game, then I honestly
gain stats well enough just from fighting monsters.

Also, I agree with Janis, that it might not be a good idea to kick
doors if you can't easily deal with nymphs.


